<title>USA: Carnegie Bancorp 1996 shr decreases.</title>
<headline>Carnegie Bancorp 1996 shr decreases.</headline>
<dateline>PRINCETON, N.J. 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year Ended December 31,</p>
<p>							1996	  1995</p>
<p>(000's omitted except for per share data)</p>
<p> Total interest income			    24,464     18,706</p>
<p> Provision for loan losses			  1,609	 369</p>
<p> Net Income					    $2,144    $2,128</p>
<p>Per Common Share:</p>
<p>	   Net income-primary			  1.01	1.08</p>
<p>	   Net income-fully diluted		  1.00	1.07</p>
<p> Weighted   average  shares  outstanding,</p>
<p>adjusted for 5 percent stock dividend</p>
<p>declared 1/15/97 (in thousands):</p>
<p>	  Primary					 2,125     1,973</p>
<p>	  Fully Diluted				 2,142     1,990</p>
<p>NOTE - Total assets at December 31, 1996, were $343.36 million versus $250.56 million at December 31, 1995.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
